    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/564072810/@arizeai/phoenix-otel@3.1.0</id>
    <updated>2026-11-17T02:11:21Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/Arize-ai/phoenix/releases/tag/%40arizeai%2Fphoenix-otel%403.1.0"/>
    <title>@arizeai/phoenix-otel@3.1.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h3&gt;Minor Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;commit&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;https://github.com/Arize-ai/phoenix/commit/f35755badeb865d05f5b2d489027201d9e4dc9d5/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Arize-ai/phoenix/commit/f35755badeb865d05f5b2d489027201d9e4dc9d5&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;f35755b&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;code&gt;register()&lt;/code&gt; accepts &lt;code&gt;sampler&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;spanLimits&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;AlwaysOnSampler&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;AlwaysOffSampler&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ParentBasedSampler&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;TraceIdRatioBasedSampler&lt;/code&gt; are re-exported. When &lt;code&gt;OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER_ARG&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;OTEL_SPAN_*&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;OTEL_ATTRIBUTE_*&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code&gt;OTEL_BSP_*&lt;/code&gt; is set and the matching setting is not configured in code, &lt;code&gt;register()&lt;/code&gt; (or, for &lt;code&gt;OTEL_BSP_*&lt;/code&gt; with custom processors, the re-exported &lt;code&gt;BatchSpanProcessor&lt;/code&gt;) logs one warning per variable, since OpenTelemetry JS 3 ignores them. The re-exported &lt;code&gt;BatchSpanProcessor&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;SimpleSpanProcessor&lt;/code&gt; throw a &lt;code&gt;TypeError&lt;/code&gt; when given an exporter positionally instead of &lt;code&gt;{ exporter }&lt;/code&gt;, rather than dropping every span.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
